    "title": "My Ride K-12",
    "description": "Easily find your student's bus route, receive real-time updates, and get push notifications about changes or delays.* \r\n\r\nThe My Ride K-12 app is designed to help parents and students stay informed about their school transportation schedules. My Ride K-12 is a must-have app for any parent or student who hopes to never miss the bus again.. \r\nDownload today and experience hassle-free school transportation.\r\n \r\n*The availability of features is managed by your school district's transportation office. For questions about the My Ride K-12 app, please contact your school district.",
